I’ll begin with the paper’s exact definitions, hardness/easy regimes, and—before coding—the certificate-production question: what algorithm finds an \(H\)-linkage, at what cost, and whether this supports Track A or only Track B. I’ll then either document a justified rejection or build and run the full generator, gate suite, and hardening harness.
web search: 
web search: https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.06675
web search: 
