- [Placebo-hint transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2407.06675/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

The only blocker is STEP 4: every OpenRouter call returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded.” Those errors were preserved but do not count as oracle failures, so the family cannot yet be claimed as hardened. Replenishing the OpenRouter quota and rerunning the three harness arms is required before submission.
